<title>SOUTH AFRICA: FORECAST - S.African company results consensus.</title>
<headline>FORECAST - S.African company results consensus.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Analysts estimates of major South African company results expected next week include the following (all figures cents per share):</p>
<p>DAY--COMPANY------------PERIOD--CONSENSUS----RANGE---------PVS--</p>
<p>MON  Nampak		 H1 EPS  58.0	   57.0-58.0     52.2</p>
<p>MON  Nampak		 H1 DIV  14.7	   13.7-16.3     13.7</p>
<p>TUE  SAB		    YR EPS  617.8	  599.0-630.8   540.8</p>
<p>TUE  SAB		    YR DIV  286.3	  280.0-290.0   250.0</p>
<p>TUE  Tiger		  H1 EPS  209.0	  200.0-220.5   180.7</p>
<p>TUE  Tiger		  H1 DIV  53.6	   52.3-54.5     44.5</p>
<p>THU  Nedcor		 H1 EPS  261.3	  256.2-264.6   210.0</p>
<p>THU  Nedcor		 H1 DIV  55.4	   54.0-56.7     45.0</p>
<p>NOTE- SAB earnings per share are fully diluted. Tiger earnings per share are before exceptional items.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
